<p>Hey there, I'm a new researcher working on a very <em>futuristic</em> scip, and I'm looking for people who have a large understanding of the very things we don't understand: black holes. What would happen if a ship maintained orbit around a spinning supermassive black hole? What if somebody was to broadcast a message in the ergosphere? What if something faster than light flew towards a black hole?<br />
I have too many questions. Also, what are professional terms surrounding these things, and <strong>how would you theoretically destroy one</strong>? Also, if you have similar questions, ask them here.</p>

